{"1173980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadow of the Road", "steam_appid": 1173980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/cf20a1a2484c1f1886fade495a588b6f.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/cf20a1a2484c1f1886fade495a588b6f.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Step into 1868 Japan, a land fiercely divided by a brutal civil war between the traditionalist forces of Shōgun Tokugawa and the technologically superior army of Emperor Mutsuhito, backed by the British East Nippon Company. Amidst this turmoil, warriors, spies, and mystical beings navigate a world where magic and machinery intertwine, the jarring contrast of tradition and technology permeating even the landscape, where weathered, ancient temples stand alongside towering steam-powered machines. Experience a country at a pivotal crossroads, torn between its cherished ancient heritage and the relentless march of modernization. Which side will emerge victorious? The fate of Japan hangs in the balance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/0ed88ab60644d1f20e2fb27556ef6f38.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/0ed88ab60644d1f20e2fb27556ef6f38.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take part in a daring mission led by Tokugawa's own spymaster, who has recruited the rōnin, Satoru and Akira, to protect a mysterious boy with immense, uncontrollable powers. Throughout their arduous journey, new heroes will join their cause, each with their own past and motivations. Together, they will confront tremendous and ever-growing dangers, striving to reclaim their honor and change the course of history. Every choice you make will guide your characters along unique and captivating paths: form new bonds, sever lifelong friendships, or mend fractured family ties. Your decisions will shape who they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/6f515085aeca3e0db8db1e88c9e90276.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/6f515085aeca3e0db8db1e88c9e90276.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take on the role of master strategist as you guide your band of warriors in both combat and conscience. Each character has a variety of backgrounds and skills, as well as their own motivations, desires, and fears... Build a team that compliments your preferred tactics and your personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/462e02657e0cbde4268cabeded502212.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=279 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/462e02657e0cbde4268cabeded502212.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Experience classic, turn-based combat with a samurai-tactics flare. Each team member brings their own distinctive set of skills and abilities to the battlefield. Even their personal goals and relationships influence every encounter. If you can master these social and strategic dynamics, then you and your team will no doubt dominate the battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/cf20a1a2484c1f1886fade495a588b6f.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=570 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/cf20a1a2484c1f1886fade495a588b6f.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Step into 1868 Japan, a land fiercely divided by a brutal civil war between the traditionalist forces of Shōgun Tokugawa and the technologically superior army of Emperor Mutsuhito, backed by the British East Nippon Company. Amidst this turmoil, warriors, spies, and mystical beings navigate a world where magic and machinery intertwine, the jarring contrast of tradition and technology permeating even the landscape, where weathered, ancient temples stand alongside towering steam-powered machines. Experience a country at a pivotal crossroads, torn between its cherished ancient heritage and the relentless march of modernization. Which side will emerge victorious? The fate of Japan hangs in the balance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/0ed88ab60644d1f20e2fb27556ef6f38.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/0ed88ab60644d1f20e2fb27556ef6f38.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take part in a daring mission led by Tokugawa's own spymaster, who has recruited the rōnin, Satoru and Akira, to protect a mysterious boy with immense, uncontrollable powers. Throughout their arduous journey, new heroes will join their cause, each with their own past and motivations. Together, they will confront tremendous and ever-growing dangers, striving to reclaim their honor and change the course of history. Every choice you make will guide your characters along unique and captivating paths: form new bonds, sever lifelong friendships, or mend fractured family ties. Your decisions will shape who they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/6f515085aeca3e0db8db1e88c9e90276.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/6f515085aeca3e0db8db1e88c9e90276.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Take on the role of master strategist as you guide your band of warriors in both combat and conscience. Each character has a variety of backgrounds and skills, as well as their own motivations, desires, and fears... Build a team that compliments your preferred tactics and your personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/462e02657e0cbde4268cabeded502212.poster.avif?t=1787761923\" width=1170 height=279 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/extras/462e02657e0cbde4268cabeded502212.webm?t=1787761923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Experience classic, turn-based combat with a samurai-tactics flare. Each team member brings their own distinctive set of skills and abilities to the battlefield. Even their personal goals and relationships influence every encounter. If you can master these social and strategic dynamics, then you and your team will no doubt dominate the battlefield.</p>", "short_description": "Shadow of the Road is a story-driven, turn-based RPG where feudal Japan meets magic and machine. Assemble your team from a diverse set of characters and test your skills against yōkai and steampunk contraptions. Carve your own path through an immersive story and change the fate of the Empire.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian, German, French, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/6c1ef91b03a8585504ec3606088adccc6514d4d7/header.jpg?t=1787761923", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/f0c73a2a681de9d694ae9e180c93f8e2a5ebddcf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787761923", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1173980/f0c73a2a681de9d694ae9e180c93f8e2a5ebddcf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787761923", "website": "https://shadowoftheroad.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> </li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</